description: Backend FastAPI and Python conventions
globs: backend/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/codebase-explanation/backend.md` before editing.

- Work in `backend/app/` — one route per file, one model per file, focused services.
- Async SQLAlchemy, Pydantic V2 schemas, type hints on all new code.
- JWT auth and `require_admin` where existing patterns use them.
- Run `cd backend && pytest -q` before considering backend work done.
- MCP tool changes require 3-file sync: `tools.py`, `agent_proxy.py`, `server.py` — see skill `add-mcp-tool`.

Delegate cross-layer contract changes to `helm-protocol` before frontend implementation.
